/* crowd_kms.c — the native dancer ON THE GLASS. 2026-07-22.
 * Takes DRM master on card1 (vc4, Composite-1 -> the CRT), renders the baked crowd via GBM/EGL
 * (kmsro hands the GL to v3d), page-flips forever. Under construction BY DESIGN — jacob wants the
 * port visible on stream with all its imperfections while it grows into the show.
 *   ./crowd_kms <slots> <packdir>      (loads every .rpack in packdir, deals round-robin)
 * Build: gcc -O2 -o crowd_kms crowd_kms.c -I/usr/include/libdrm -ldrm -lgbm -lEGL -lGLESv2 -lm
 * Stop: SIGINT/SIGTERM. Restore the old show: reboot (autologin brings labwc+kiosk back) or
 * restart labwc + reva-dancer by hand.
 */
